    "_nDownloadCount": 573,
    "_sText": "Spiritual successor of Level Palette Scripted (I guess), character underwater palettes are now handled by scripts by tinting the primary\/above water palette.<br><br>Changes\/enhancements with this mod: more accurate\/realistic colors (especially for Knuckles), underwater palette for Super\/Hyper Tails\/Knuckles, HCZ's underwater palette is now tinted green, and separated CNZ and LBZ's underwater palettes<br><br>has support for Chemical Plant Zone, and should be compatible with pretty much any character (as far as I've tested)<br><br><span class=\"GreenColor\">Free to use with credits (other than directly reuploading), feel free to add this for your extra slot character or something if you don't feel like doing the colors manually<\/span>",
